cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: "Quant4D (MATLAB)"
abstract: >-
  Quant4D is an open source graphical interface for quickly and intuitively
  opening, interacting with, and performing basic analysis of 4D-STEM data.
  This is the MATLAB version; a Python version, with optional GPU acceleration,
  is archived separately.
authors:
